    "simple_cC7cCR": {
      "type": "simple",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Crafted in the USA Using Globally Sourced Materials",
        "subheading": "",
        "content": "<p>With Pepper, you get access to some of the country’s best craftspeople, from the accomplished artists who create our exclusive prints to the trusted American manufacturers who make our products. Their thorough, thoughtful techniques are probably why nearly every Pepper product has a five-star rating. <br/><br/>Additionally, each piece is made-to-order using sustainable, low-waste methods that keep our products in homes and out of landfills.</p>",
