        "review_ERhC93": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "<p>I had received an outrageous quote for drapes and looked for alternatives and found Pepper Home. I took a chance and I<br/>am so glad I did! The drapes are beautiful, and the fabric is heavy weight and quality.</p>",
            "source": "LAUREN E."
          }
        },
        "review_4NgFzy": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "<p>Fabulous service. Pepper Home not only offers beautiful high quality home accents, but also remarkable customer service. Will always use Pepper Home for our interior design projects.</p>",
            "source": "Marissa S."
          }
        },
        "review_7fjFzJ": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "<p>I am so happy with the quality and color of this wallpaper ! It was just installed in my powder room and I’m absolutely obsessed with it!</p>",
            "source": "Lauren H."
          }
        },
        "review_9kGjVY": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "<p>Arrived quickly, needed no ironing, weights in the lower seams to keep them from blowing about. Clearly made to last. Was between these and more expensive ones from Anthropologie. So glad I chose these.</p>",
            "source": "Emily W."
          }
        },
        "review_gkPGBf": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "<p>We love these curtains! They are beautiful and functional. They completely black out our room and we get a great night’s rest. </p>",
            "source": "Casey P."
          }
        },
        "review_RNQqix": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "<p>The Blake wallpaper turned out beautifully. The quality is amazing. It transformed our space.</p>",
