        },
        "review_8LiQGm": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "<p>Stunning shower curtain! The snow shower curtain with fern trim is beautiful in my guest bathroom! It is even better than I ever expected!</p>",
            "source": "Janet L."
          }
        },
        "review_BGpKhg": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "<p>Beautiful and well made! I needed an extra long shower curtain to camouflage an unattractive but perfectly functional shower. This Frida Green works wonderfully. Thank you for providing the perfect solution!</p>",
            "source": "Lynn M."
          }
        },
        "review_BcLFDx": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "<p>The color combination in this fabric is so playful! I love everything about the pillows I ordered, the quality of the fabric, the custom look, pretty packaging and sweet service.</p>",
            "source": "Kristy W."
          }
        }
